  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Build Kenya&apos;s climate resilience by improving generation, access to and use of weather and climate information services.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The interventions will build climate resilience and reduce humanitarian need, helping to position the UK as a leader in this area.  We will also be practically supporting Kenya&apos;s objectives on regional climate leadership and expertise, particularly by strengthening their role and &apos;offer&apos; to the East African region as a &apos;Regional Specialist Met Centre&apos;.</narrative>
  </description>
